Goodies
=======

Optional extras that go well with mWizard: an application icon set, a set of
higher resolution Motif dialog icons, an X cursor theme, and GTK 2/3
configuration files that match the Motif look.

None of them are required. mWizard neither builds nor installs them unless you
ask for it.

    make goodies            unpack and build them under goodies/build
    make install-goodies    install them (as root)
    make uninstall-goodies  remove them again


