CONTENTS
========

app-icons.tar.xz
    Generic 48x48 application icons in pixel-art style, for applications that
    ship no icon of their own. Installed to $(PREFIX)/share/mwizard/icons.
    Point the bitmapDirectory setting at that path, or name them directly in
    an iconImage setting.

xmdlgicons.tar.xz
    Motif dialog icons (error, information, question, warning, working) at 32
    and 48 pixels, for roughly 96 and 130 DPI screens respectively. Installed
    to $(RCDIR)/bitmaps, one of the paths Motif searches. The 32px set is
    installed by default; see the archive's own README for the 48px set and
    for XBMLANGPATH.

xc-core-hr.tar.xz
    A sharp-edged X cursor theme built on the look of the X11 core cursors, in
    24 and 32 pixel sizes. Building it needs xcursorgen(1); if that is not
    installed, "make goodies" skips this one and says so. Installed to
    $(PREFIX)/share/icons/core-hr. To use it, set:

        Xcursor.theme: core-hr
        Xcursor.size:  24

gtk-configs.tar.xz
    GTK 2 and GTK 3 configuration matching the default Motif colors, so GTK
    applications do not look out of place. These are per-user dotfiles and are
    deliberately NOT installed system-wide. Copy them yourself:

        cp goodies/build/gtk-configs/gtkrc-2.0 ~/.gtkrc-2.0
        mkdir -p ~/.config/gtk-3.0
        cp goodies/build/gtk-configs/gtk.css ~/.config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css
